  "editorialSummary": "Nothing says modern progress quite like Wall Street enduring a [historic tech stock rout](https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOVjhNSkxWaHNDNkkxUE51NVdvLXhyVzJ5ZGRmUHNrSUlNcG05TXRBZ2JVV3RPWk45RUxySTlZME9BRklSTFBTTzJUX294eHF5MXRkeGRMejl4SmY2MFJCckxRcmZnWXVoYnV5ang4VDZmenBqbU1Ld0NKSWIyMGdDOUxZaVhUWFVfRzg1eHlwbnk3OENMVFVybkVxc3k0b1ExMlY0WVdoSGFSdGFPclpsdWFTUHdfaVN6cnJaRUo4WFVEUQ?oc=5) while European airports field [malicious hoax threats](https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmpqg08nz3pqo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss) and automated hackers plunder [French bank reserves](https://www.france24.com/en/cyberattack-french-bank-says-online-hacking-stole-around-100-million). At this rate, the physicists exploring the [zeptoverse at the LHC](https://www.newscientist.com/article/2597289-beauty-particle-decay-opens-the-door-to-the-zeptoverse/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&utm_content=home&utm_medium=RSS&utm_source=NSNS) are mostly just looking for a smaller hiding spot.",
